Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.80,0:00:50.67,Title,0,0,0,0,,《异形大战铁血战士2：安魂曲》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.20,0:03:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 慢慢来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, now, take your time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.76,0:03:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.56,0:03:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 爸爸 在上面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad! Dad! It's up here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.28,0:03:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢点 山姆 慢点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slow down, Sam, slow down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.08,0:04:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.64,0:04:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我们 我们得去通知警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we're… we're gonna show this to the sheriff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.64,0:04:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？好了 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening? Come on, let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.20,0:04:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on… go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.44,0:04:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 跑 跑 跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move it. Go, go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.88,0:04:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 山姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, Sam…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.96,0:04:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,山姆 你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, you all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.68,0:04:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,低头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.60,0:05:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 我害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, I'm scared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.60,0:05:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.68,0:05:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.96,0:05:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.68,0:07:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好吧 达拉斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you doin', Dallas?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.75,0:07:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.44,0:07:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦 我带你一段吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, I'll give you a ride.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.96,0:07:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前都是坐在后面的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I usually ride in the back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.84,0:07:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得有几次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I seem to remember you being with me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.68,0:08:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是你在前面开车吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}a couple of those times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.24,0:08:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,能问你点东西？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask you something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.64,0:08:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 呃 你后悔吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, uh… You regret what you did?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.48,0:08:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.32,0:08:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 你觉得我应该后悔？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? You thought I would?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.80,0:08:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是觉得三年该够长了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think three years is a long time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.04,0:08:21.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么？你在雇人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got work lined up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.68,0:08:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找到工作了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? You hiring?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.80,0:08:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说服别人够麻烦的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got enough trouble convincing people{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.52,0:08:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I belong on the job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.40,0:08:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 我愿意跑遍整个镇子来找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'll ask around town for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.88,0:08:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很感激\N{\fnArial\fs30}I appreciate it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.68,0:08:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 见到我弟弟了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, uh… seen my brother?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.88,0:08:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上 我见他见得都烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, I been seeing him too much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.48,0:08:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,大佬比萨店 需要点什么吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pizza One. How can I help you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.28,0:08:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得带帽子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotta wear the hat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.60,0:08:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,祖 你让我们带帽子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drew, the only reason you make us wear a hat{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.88,0:08:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,仅仅是因为当你以前当司机的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}is 'cause some manager made you wear a hat{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.80,0:08:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,某些经理要求你带帽子\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you were a driver.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.32,0:08:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 你能得到这份工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, the only reason you got this job{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.24,0:09:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,仅仅是因为你的监护顾问\N{\fnArial\fs30}is because your guidance counselor begged me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.24,0:09:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,求着我给你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}to give it to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.60,0:09:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我知道她的性感\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm sure the fact that she's hot{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.64,0:09:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟这没有一点关系 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}had nothing to do with that, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.68,0:09:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,水冠街1427号\N{\fnArial\fs30}1427 Watercrest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.40,0:09:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能送这个货\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't make that delivery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.72,0:09:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,让白瑞去送吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have Barry do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.36,0:09:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里不讲民主\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not a democracy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.40,0:09:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么送过去 要么走人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make the run or you're fired.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.32,0:09:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得带帽子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And wear the hat!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.04,0:09:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,巡逻31号大卫报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is R- 31- David{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.08,0:09:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在对4号下水道枢纽例行检查\N{\fnArial\fs30}investigating a 10- 66 at sewer junction four.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.24,0:09:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 巡逻31号大卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy that, R- 31- David.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.40,0:10:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈瑞 跟你说过多少次了 叫你这些人不要到这儿来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harry… we keep telling you guys to stay out of here…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.24,0:10:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你却老跑回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you keep coming back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.60,0:10:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想这样做 不过我必须得把你带回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate to do this, but I'm gonna have to take you in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.00,0:10:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我找找我的狗吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me just get my dog.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.52,0:10:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,布斥？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Butch?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.32,0:10:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,布斥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Butch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.40,0:10:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here, boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.20,0:10:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.72,0:10:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.60,0:10:37.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,警长 警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh… Sheriff, Sheriff…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.68,0:11:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 瑞奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Ricky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.32,0:11:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 杰西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Jesse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.32,0:11:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,进来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.88,0:11:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你拿点喝的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I get you something to drink?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.20,0:11:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用了 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm good, thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.28,0:11:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,装备不错啊 瑞奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a cute outfit, Ricky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.04,0:11:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 是不是圣诞提前到了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, isn't Halloween in October?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.72,0:11:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少我知道谁订了「腊肠情人」\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least now I know who ordered the "Sausage Lover's."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.28,0:11:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.60,0:11:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的钱包在厨房里\N{\fnArial\fs30}My purse is in the kitchen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.72,0:11:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.60,0:12:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他真是个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can be such an asshole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.32,0:12:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 没错 你一直都知道怎么结交他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well… you've always known how to pick 'em, Jess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.68,0:12:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以告诉你个小秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'll let you in on a little secret:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.72,0:12:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我准备解雇他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting ready to fire him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.52,0:12:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,解雇他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.40,0:12:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,很有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's funny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.20,0:12:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要付你多少钱？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what do I owe you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.28,0:12:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩 53.50圆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh… $53.50.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.32,0:12:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,别找了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.48,0:12:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.68,0:12:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,等会见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.68,0:12:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.76,0:12:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴尔 戴尔 住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dale! Dale, stop it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.92,0:12:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,就为了一个微笑 值得吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was that laugh you got worth it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.24,0:12:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不回答？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh? No answer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.56,0:12:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴尔 让他走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dale, leave him alone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.00,0:12:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,把钥匙给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me my keys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.16,0:13:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你能不能在30分钟内 找到钥匙 蠢货\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you can find 'em in 30 minutes or less, asshole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.28,0:13:06.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.72,0:13:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.84,0:13:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,比萨小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pizza boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.48,0:13:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,回家 杰西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go, Jesse!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.96,0:13:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,试着发现更多的信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try and get more information{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.44,0:13:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到可能的伤员 并且报告是否需要救护车\N{\fnArial\fs30}and call about possible injuries and whether medical is needed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.32,0:13:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,救护车 死者 （美国警方无线电用语）\N{\fnArial\fs30}14-29.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.72,0:14:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷 你发现了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ray, you find anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.96,0:14:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.20,0:14:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人把车停在岔路口吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone parked at the turnout?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.00,0:14:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴迪·本森的卡车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buddy Benson's truck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.96,0:14:22.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐 艾迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, Eddie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.96,0:14:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一般都和孩子一起出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He usually goes out with his kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.00,0:14:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.32,0:15:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.12,0:15:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.68,0:15:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真想你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I missed you so much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.72,0:15:51.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,她长这么大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's so big!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.20,0:15:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.20,0:15:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.68,0:15:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝 我真不敢相信你回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}God. I can't believe you're home!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.08,0:15:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been so long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.04,0:16:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我帮你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want some help?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.44,0:16:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些是给我的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are these for me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.68,0:16:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不喜欢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't like them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.60,0:16:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 你开玩笑吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, are you kidding me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.32,0:16:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are so cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.88,0:16:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,等会我们来教你怎么用 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll show you how they work later, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.48,0:16:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.52,0:16:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.96,0:16:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.16,0:16:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的门有问题吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a problem with the door?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.68,0:16:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么时候回来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When'd you get back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.40,0:16:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.60,0:16:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的脸怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to your face?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.36,0:16:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,等会儿再谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk about it later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.88,0:16:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ricky…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.68,0:16:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 我们等会儿再谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey! - We'll talk about it later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.68,0:16:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们现在就谈 - 把手拿开\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's talk about it now. - Get your hands off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.60,0:16:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你该死的手拿开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your fuckin' hands off me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.96,0:17:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的脸到底怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to your face?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.72,0:17:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴尔·科林斯和他的朋友打了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dale Collins and his friends jumped me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.24,0:17:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,还把我的钥匙扔进下水道\N{\fnArial\fs30}They threw my keys in the sewer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.60,0:17:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 把球棒给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, give me the bat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.64,0:17:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在这里干什么？- 瑞奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing here… - Ricky…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.60,0:17:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要干什么？- 我不会再说一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing?! - I'm not gonna ask…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.32,0:17:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那该死的球棒给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the fuckin' bat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.64,0:17:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦 我帮你去找钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on… I'll help you find your keys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.76,0:18:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,布斥 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Butch, shut up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.68,0:18:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈瑞？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.20,0:18:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好给我留点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better save some for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.20,0:18:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 老天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.96,0:18:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 哈瑞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Harry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.60,0:19:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.52,0:24:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.00,0:24:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉 你该睡了 甜心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. It's your bedtime, honey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.56,0:24:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还不困呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sleepy yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.48,0:24:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,茉莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Molly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.48,0:24:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它放到一边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put those away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.16,0:24:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,该睡觉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time for bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.88,0:24:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.12,0:25:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想让爸爸读\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want Dad to read it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.24,0:25:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.60,0:25:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.04,0:25:17.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天早上见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you in the morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.80,0:25:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.40,0:25:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.24,0:25:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你记得多少次\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember all those times{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.26,0:25:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟我说你很想念妈妈？\N{\fnArial\fs30}you told me how much you missed Mommy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.08,0:25:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉她 没关系的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay to tell Mommy that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.20,0:25:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.92,0:25:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.32,0:26:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.68,0:26:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把她照顾得很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've done an amazing job with her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.52,0:26:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,她一直很想你\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's missed you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.88,0:26:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我离开 她生我气\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's angry that I left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.80,0:26:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,茉莉只是需要点时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Molly just needs a little time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.12,0:26:20.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我犯了个错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I made a mistake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.56,0:26:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 你没有犯错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, no. You didn't make a mistake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.52,0:26:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只是很想念你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've just missed you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.60,0:26:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也很想你们 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I missed you too. Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.84,0:26:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.00,0:26:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想自己来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to do it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.04,0:26:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是家里的罪人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the convict in the family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.16,0:26:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Funny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.24,0:26:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我一下 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me out, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.44,0:26:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么我们不从\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't we just climb down{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.96,0:26:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们扔钥匙的地方爬下去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}from where they threw your keys?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.80,0:27:01.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样杰西就可以看到我满身是屎地爬出来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Jesse can see me climb out covered in shit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.44,0:27:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.76,0:27:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.76,0:27:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会满身是屎？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna be covered in shit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.64,0:27:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.40,0:27:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下面真恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gross down here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.64,0:27:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能想出更恶心的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can think of worse places.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.84,0:27:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜没人在家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess nobody's home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.76,0:27:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是个睡椅吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a couch?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.48,0:27:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.08,0:27:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,比咱家的好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nicer than ours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.48,0:27:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.80,0:28:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 闻起来像有东西死在这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it smells like something died down here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.80,0:28:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定是这条路？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure this is the right way?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.76,0:28:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该就在那上边\N{\fnArial\fs30}This should be it right up here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.60,0:28:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这个下水道\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the drain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.36,0:28:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,检查下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check down there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.16,0:28:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你的钥匙 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're your keys, asshole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.75,0:28:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有手\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.92,0:28:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 不过我可不打算把手叉到那堆屎里 你自己捞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and I'm not sticking 'em in that shit. You do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.68,0:28:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪你自己吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knock yourself out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.04,0:28:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我说说这个女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me about this girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.52,0:28:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪个女孩？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What girl?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.76,0:28:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你屁股挨揍的女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one you got your ass kicked over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.96,0:28:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,就只是个女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.44,0:29:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人只是为了个一般女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one goes digging around through shit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.72,0:29:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,在屎里面挖东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}over just some girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.72,0:29:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.52,0:29:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他妈是什么玩意？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.56,0:29:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松 就是只老鼠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax. It's just a rat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.08,0:29:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他妈才不是老鼠\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's no fuckin' rat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.08,0:29:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 检查下那个下水道\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, check that drain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.76,0:29:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got 'em.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.36,0:29:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.96,0:29:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的 警长 巴迪的老婆来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit, Sheriff. That's Buddy's wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.88,0:29:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我们有伴儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, we got some company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.92,0:30:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 达西 - 艾迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Darcy. - Eddie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.20,0:30:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没收到任何消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't heard anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.72,0:30:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们正在找他们 - 他们可能受伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're looking for them. - They could be hurt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.32,0:30:06.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们也可能正在回家的路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or they could be on their way home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.76,0:30:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在浪费时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're wasting your time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.08,0:30:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 伙计们 请回到你的车里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, folks, please, go back and get in your cars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.72,0:30:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾迪 我的家人在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie, my family is out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.20,0:30:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会找到他们的 交给我们吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're gonna find them. Let us handle it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.28,0:30:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天晚上你们去寻找 太危险了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too dangerous out there for you all to search tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.80,0:30:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在开始 我们自己负责了 警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Around here, we take care of our own, Sheriff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.72,0:30:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管有没有你们 我们都会去找的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna do the search whether you like it or not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.24,0:30:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,山姆？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.52,0:30:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷 往桥那边走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ray, head towards the bridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.88,0:30:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,山姆 你在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy, where are you?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.28,0:30:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buddy?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.72,0:30:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴迪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buddy?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.40,0:30:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,山姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.28,0:30:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯莉 把他们带过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kelly, bring 'em in!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.28,0:30:47.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪儿 巴迪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you, Buddy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.32,0:30:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,山姆？山姆？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam? Sam?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.20,0:30:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴迪 巴迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buddy! Buddy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.12,0:30:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buddy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.52,0:30:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会扔下你不管的 山姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}We won't stop looking for you, Sammy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.92,0:31:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾迪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.32,0:31:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,达西 我们明天再来找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darcy, we'll start up again tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.00,0:31:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的丈夫和孩子就在里面 某个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}My husband and my son are out here… somewhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.28,0:31:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不会扔下我不管的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They wouldn't stop looking for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.68,0:31:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think that…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.68,0:31:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}something happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.48,0:31:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.24,0:31:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不回家去 休息一下？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you go home and get some rest?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.08,0:31:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 我们需要你的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, we need your strength.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.44,0:32:00.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.48,0:32:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们明天早上集合\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going to regroup tomorrow in the morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.48,0:32:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,在晚上找没什么用\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're no good at night here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.88,0:32:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷 有发现吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ray, anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.16,0:32:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negative.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.40,0:32:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我将最后一次检查大桥那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna make a final pass by the ridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.24,0:32:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 保持联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, keep in touch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.40,0:32:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 我明天早上再找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Otherwise, I'll see you in the morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.24,0:33:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有单位 报告情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}All units, report back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.60,0:33:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,请原谅 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.76,0:33:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你见到了我丈夫和儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you've seen my husband or my son…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.36,0:33:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.79,0:33:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,请原谅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pardon me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.80,0:33:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,请看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I could give you this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.12,0:33:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的丈夫和孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my husband and my son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.04,0:33:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,请留意一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just keep an eye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.76,0:33:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当然 - 谢谢你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, sure. - Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.68,0:33:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉那森小镇因为最近\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gunnison residents have been jolted{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.64,0:33:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个男子和他孩子的神秘失踪而震动\N{\fnArial\fs30}by the mysterious disappearance of a man and his young son{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.76,0:34:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,在昨天的搜救过程中\N{\fnArial\fs30}during a hunting trip yesterday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.75,0:34:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴迪·本森 吉那森镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buddy Benson, a repair supervisor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.80,0:34:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,电信公司的高级工程师\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the Gunnison telephone company{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.16,0:34:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有他的儿子 山姆 并没有回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}and his young son, Sam, never returned home last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.16,0:34:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,茉莉？宝贝 过来吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Molly? Honey, come eat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.56,0:34:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,工作找的怎么样了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's the job hunt going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.04,0:34:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,破门而入算不算特长？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is breaking and entering a special skill?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.80,0:34:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么建议吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got any suggestions?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.04,0:34:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说银行在招人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear the bank's hiring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.96,0:34:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,早啊 警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning, Sheriff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.79,0:34:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.76,0:34:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,早\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.84,0:34:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴迪和他的儿子有消息了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any word on Buddy and his kid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.64,0:34:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯瑞？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carrie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.24,0:34:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,请倒点咖啡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coffee, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.20,0:34:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们整晚都在找？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys have been out all night, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.48,0:34:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 我们两点就停下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. We called it off at 2:00 a.m.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.20,0:35:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷没有回家？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ray didn't come home?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.64,0:35:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾迪 我以为他跟着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie, I thought he was out with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.68,0:35:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打过他的手机\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried his cell phone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.72,0:35:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯瑞 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carrie, listen to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.44,0:35:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷昨天晚上很着急\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ray was pushing real hard last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.04,0:35:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我肯定他还在找\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure he's still looking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.52,0:35:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,监狱管理那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cell reception out there…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.76,0:35:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他平时都会打的 艾迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}He always calls, Eddie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.52,0:35:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ray!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.96,0:35:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ray?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.32,0:35:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷 你在那边吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ray, you down there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.20,0:35:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ray?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.76,0:36:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 老天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.60,0:36:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不相信这是 雷·亚当姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe this is Ray Adams.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.96,0:36:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不想相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to believe it either.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.20,0:36:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道什么能驱使一个人这么干？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Know what it would take for a man to do this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.20,0:36:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,让一个人 活活剥别人的皮？\N{\fnArial\fs30}For someone to… skin a human being?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.76,0:36:35.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有一点痕迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were no tracks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.32,0:36:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.84,0:36:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾迪 这次太麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie, you're in over your head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.76,0:36:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算怎么做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you going to do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.48,0:36:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想出来后 会告诉你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll let you know when I figure it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.28,0:38:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.48,0:38:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 杰西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Jesse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.52,0:38:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.40,0:38:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 在教室你就是用这种眼神看我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you look at me that same way in class.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.92,0:38:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 啊 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.44,0:38:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,钟表在你背后\N{\fnArial\fs30}the clock's behind you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.04,0:38:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.32,0:38:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天你去上课的时候 回头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomorrow when you're in class, turn around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.80,0:38:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就能看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll see it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.92,0:39:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.20,0:39:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道钟在那儿 不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that it's there, but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.16,0:39:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都知道 你看的不是钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}we both know that's not what you're looking at.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.76,0:39:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 你一直不善于说谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you never were a good liar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.60,0:39:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚 你想去游泳吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want to go swimming tonight?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.28,0:39:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,游泳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Swimming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.72,0:39:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.40,0:39:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,学校\N{\fnArial\fs30}At school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.04,0:39:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 就跟过去一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, it'll be like old times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.68,0:39:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去 在你有男朋友之前？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Old times like before you had a boyfriend?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.16,0:39:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.12,0:39:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 实际上 是前男友\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's ex- boyfriend, actually.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.52,0:39:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他被解雇了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been fired.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.68,0:39:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 今晚？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.48,0:39:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,10点左右\N{\fnArial\fs30}Around 10:00.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.32,0:39:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上见\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.96,0:42:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正在关门 达西\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're closing out now, Darcy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.39,0:42:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你过来再见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you when you get here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.48,0:42:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.16,0:43:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want to talk…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.84,0:43:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.80,0:43:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚你可以跟我还有凯西住在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome to stay with me and Cathy tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.80,0:43:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,达西正在赶过来 我跟她一起住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darcy's coming by… I'm gonna stay with her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.20,0:43:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.60,0:44:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在树林里找到了雷的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}We found Ray's body in the woods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.00,0:44:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他 嗯 他被活活剥了皮\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was, uh… he was skinned alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.56,0:45:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得这跟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think it's got something to do with…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.20,0:45:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴迪和他的孩子的失踪有关？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buddy and his kid disappearing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.88,0:45:07.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得这种事从来没发生过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think this kind of thing doesn't happen here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.52,0:45:10.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你告诉他妻子了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You told his wife?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.84,0:45:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,警长 我们收到报告说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheriff, we have a report{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.48,0:45:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,16区下水道有小规模煤气爆炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}of a small gas explosion in the sewer under 16th.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.64,0:45:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你收到了吗？- 明白 分派员\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you copy? - Roger, Dispatch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.00,0:45:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 通知消防队 - 我们在那儿跟他们汇合\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Notify the fire department - I'll meet 'em there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.12,0:45:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上 警长 分派员结束通话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right away, Sheriff. Dispatch out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.40,0:45:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要帮忙吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want some help?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.64,0:45:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 达拉斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, Dallas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.88,0:45:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.56,0:45:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我坐到后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll ride in the back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.84,0:46:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,内特？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.84,0:46:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,内特？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nate?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.52,0:46:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,内特 你跑哪儿去了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nate, where are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.56,0:47:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.16,0:47:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ricky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.49,0:47:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.36,0:47:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.52,0:47:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.76,0:47:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么进去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}how do we get in?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.40,0:47:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,放学后我复制了钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I taped the lock after class.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.68,0:47:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能决定该穿哪件泳衣 所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't decide on which suit I wanted to wear, so…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.92,0:48:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 你告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now… you tell me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.12,0:48:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看的是我 还是钟？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…are you looking at me or the clock?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.12,0:48:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.24,0:48:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.64,0:48:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得你在做什么 杰丝？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think you're doing, Jess?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.60,0:48:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴尔 滚出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dale, get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.40,0:48:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住我的话 瑞奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just remember, Ricky…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.52,0:48:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个小婊子知道每件事 都是我教的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I taught this little slut everything she knows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.28,0:48:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 瑞奇 - 住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, Ricky… - stop it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.96,0:48:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 住手 - 戴尔 住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop it! - Dale, stop it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.88,0:48:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手 他会淹死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it! He's drowning!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.60,0:50:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.56,0:50:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么鬼东西？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.60,0:50:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.88,0:50:28.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝 赶快从水里出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God, get out of the water.{\r}
