Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.40,1:01:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰西 把枪上膛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesse, load them up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.76,1:01:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾迪 你有电把那东西点亮？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie, you got power on that thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.32,1:01:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我需要光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I just need some light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.16,1:01:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 走 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.24,1:01:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一小队 封锁这个区域\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ground One, secure the area.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.60,1:01:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,建立隔离带 掩护第二小队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Set up perimeter, provide cover for Ground Two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.08,1:01:55.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 零到六号出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger, Zero- 6 out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.44,1:01:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 走 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move! Move! Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.80,1:01:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,报告情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Report status.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.24,1:01:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一小队已建好隔离带\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ground One has secured perimeter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.80,1:02:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二小队已建好隔离带\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ground Two has secured perimeter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.40,1:02:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,警长马若勒斯呼叫国民警卫队 请回答\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Sheriff Morales for the National Guard. Come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.36,1:02:11.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,重复 警长马若勒斯呼叫国民警卫队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Repeat, Sheriff Morales for the National Guard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.20,1:02:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,请回答\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.88,1:02:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是国民警卫队 89师\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Lieutenant Woods, 89th Troop Command…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.88,1:02:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,伍得中尉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Colorado National Guard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.48,1:02:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,请讲 警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead, Sheriff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.88,1:02:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的位置在哪里 中尉 完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your location, Lieutenant? Over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.92,1:02:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在干道上\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're on Main Street.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.84,1:02:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 中尉 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, Lieutenant, I don't know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.13,1:02:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的人要面对什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what your men are walking into…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.48,1:02:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们的情况变得越来越糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}but our situation is getting worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.68,1:02:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,中尉 请回答 你还在吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lieutenant, come in. Are you there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.44,1:02:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有个人失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a missing man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.28,1:02:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on, Sheriff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.08,1:03:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 射击 - 我们遭遇了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fire! - We've got contact!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.56,1:03:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 停止射击 - 我们中埋伏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hold your fire! - It's a fucking ambush!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.08,1:03:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,防御 九点钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fender, 9:00!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.96,1:03:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,究竟是他妈的怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell's going on out there?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.40,1:03:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们遭遇了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got contact!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.04,1:03:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,撤退 重复 撤退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fall back! I repeat, fall back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.60,1:03:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,中尉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lieutenant!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.16,1:03:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,中尉 你在吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lieutenant, are you there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.80,1:03:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,中尉 请回答 你在吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lieutenant, come in. Are you there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.04,1:03:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们逃不了了 是吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not going to make it, are we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.32,1:04:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,别开枪 随便拿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't shoot! Take what you want!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.04,1:04:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不该为了每小时六圆两角被杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not getting killed for no $6.25 an hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.48,1:04:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们被攻击了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been attacked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.12,1:04:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怖分子袭击吉那森了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Terrorists hit Gunnison?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.24,1:04:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,早告诉你他们有天会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Told you they would one day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.48,1:04:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是什么人 喝高了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you guys, stoned?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.00,1:04:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿把枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab some rifles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.28,1:04:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到那个了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.76,1:04:35.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 茉莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry up, Molly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.36,1:04:36.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 茉莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry, Molly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.76,1:04:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.04,1:04:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.76,1:04:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你受伤了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you hurt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.68,1:04:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,进来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.76,1:04:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在这儿会安全的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll be safe here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.16,1:05:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗森医生请到2号急救室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Lossen to O.R. 2, stat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.64,1:05:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗森医生请到2号急救室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Lossen to O.R. 2, stat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.76,1:05:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,使劲压住伤口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep pressure on that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.44,1:05:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来一升\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another liter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.92,1:05:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.48,1:05:14.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,明显的外伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently got a carotid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.20,1:05:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,直接带他去急救室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take him straight to Trauma.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.20,1:05:17.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.32,1:05:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,上来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.08,1:05:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,黄色警报 黄色警报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Code yellow, code yellow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.04,1:05:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有非轮班医护人员马上到特别监护室报道\N{\fnArial\fs30}All non- shift medical personnel report to Critical Care.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.00,1:05:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.36,1:06:00.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,灯什么时候重新打开的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When are the lights going back on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.96,1:06:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,在电源恢复之前 我们起用紧急发电机\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're on emergency generators until the power's restored.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.76,1:06:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.48,1:06:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我想我的羊水破了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I think my water just broke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.76,1:06:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.96,1:06:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去找个医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll find a doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.92,1:06:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.12,1:07:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.96,1:07:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个都在发抖\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two look pretty shaken up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.44,1:07:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天晚上对她来说很不容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hasn't been an easy night for her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.92,1:07:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what about you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.68,1:07:14.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.52,1:07:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.20,1:07:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们5分钟后出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're leaving in five minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.24,1:07:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.92,1:07:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.56,1:08:02.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,把枪给我 把枪给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the gun. Give me the gun!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.12,1:08:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.40,1:08:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.80,1:08:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,回去 是个陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn back! It's a trap!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.08,1:08:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是陷阱 陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a trap! It's a trap!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.97,1:08:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么鬼玩意儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.92,1:08:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 跑 跑 跑 - 跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go! Go! Go! - Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.52,1:08:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,茉莉 快点 跑 跑 茉莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Molly, come on, run! Run, Molly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.88,1:08:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人 跑 跑 到外面去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone, go, go! Out the front!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.20,1:08:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,操他妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.12,1:08:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,打死这狗日的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot the fucking thing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.20,1:09:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 达拉斯 - 那是什么东西？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dallas… - What was that thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.16,1:09:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.68,1:09:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.08,1:09:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.84,1:09:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,出问题了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.12,1:09:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,检查下其他房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check the other rooms!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.00,1:09:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.68,1:10:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点 对 - 跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, yeah… - Go…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.56,1:10:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑 孩子 跑 别停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, baby, go! Keep running.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.20,1:10:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直往前 一直往前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Straight ahead. Straight ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.23,1:10:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.04,1:10:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我们的救援？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is our help?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.80,1:10:41.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,出了什么鬼事 艾迪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck is going on, Eddie?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.64,1:10:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,尸体都跑到哪儿去了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell are the bodies?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.16,1:10:44.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 它们会把我们全杀了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, they're gonna kill us all!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.36,1:10:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还没死\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not dead yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.04,1:10:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许还有武器和装备我们能用\N{\fnArial\fs30}There may be weapons and equipment we can still use.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.72,1:10:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,电台\N{\fnArial\fs30}Radio.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.36,1:11:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,国民警卫队 请回答\N{\fnArial\fs30}National Guard, come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.88,1:11:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,重复 国民警卫队 请回答\N{\fnArial\fs30}Repeat… any National Guard unit, come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.48,1:11:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是美国军队史迪文上校\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Colonel Stevens, U.S. Army.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.36,1:11:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,表明你们的身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}Identify yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.84,1:11:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,警长 艾迪·马若勒斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheriff Eddie Morales.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.52,1:11:19.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉那森 罗拉多州\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gunnison, Colorado.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.84,1:11:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须帮我们 上校\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to help us, Colonel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.48,1:11:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有某种异形\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's some kind of infestation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.20,1:11:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们不马上得到帮助 我们就都会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}and if we don't get help soon, there won't be any of us left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.08,1:11:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,军队的疏散计划是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the army's evacuation plan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.12,1:11:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,上校？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Colonel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.64,1:11:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,上校 我们需要立即疏散\N{\fnArial\fs30}Colonel, we need immediate evac.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.92,1:11:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,警长 所有的地面通道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheriff, all ground routes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.20,1:11:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,都不安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}have been compromised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.52,1:11:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,30分钟之后 吉莉安广场\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is an airlift in 30 minutes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.92,1:11:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,会有一次空中救援\N{\fnArial\fs30}from Gilliam Circle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.68,1:11:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,确认：空中救援 吉莉安广场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Confirm: airlift, Gilliam Circle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.72,1:11:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们20分钟后到达\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be there in 20 minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.00,1:11:50.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那是在市中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that's right in the center of town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.08,1:11:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会赶到的 上校\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be there, Colonel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.08,1:12:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是什么鬼玩意儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.28,1:12:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人 到车厢里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone, get in the Striker!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.00,1:12:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll drive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.44,1:12:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,上车 快 快 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up, go, go, go, go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.88,1:12:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定你能开这玩意儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure you can drive that thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.00,1:12:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我来负责拿枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I'll get on the gun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.44,1:12:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,别打偏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't miss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.00,1:12:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,别撞车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't crash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.04,1:12:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓紧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.36,1:14:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么停下来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are we stopping?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.92,1:14:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这没一点道理\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't make any sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.12,1:14:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉莉安广场在小镇的正中央\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gilliam Circle is right in the center of town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.20,1:14:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会被那些东西包围的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be surrounded by those things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.68,1:14:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等下 你在说什么？- 我认为上校在骗我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait a second… what are you saying? - I think the colonel was lying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.23,1:14:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,真荒谬\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.04,1:14:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,政府从来不对人民撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}The government doesn't lie to people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.00,1:14:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,军队会首先考虑污染\N{\fnArial\fs30}The army thinks about containment first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.12,1:14:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不能冒险让情况变得更糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can't risk this getting any worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.12,1:14:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,救援就在几公里以外的地方 他们正在等我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help is a few miles down that road and they're waiting for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.44,1:14:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不想带我们去 我带\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, if you won't drive us there, I will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.16,1:14:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾迪 如果她是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie, if she's right, the only thing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.40,1:14:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,等着我们的就是更多的异形\N{\fnArial\fs30}down that road are more of those things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.84,1:14:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有认真考虑这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not seriously considering this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.16,1:14:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我考虑如何让我们活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm considering whatever keeps us alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.04,1:14:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是逃出这个镇子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means getting out of this town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.16,1:14:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,镇里只有两架直升机\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are only two helicopters in town…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.84,1:14:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但一架在机场\N{\fnArial\fs30}but one's at the airport.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.08,1:14:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 太远了 我们不可能到那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's too far. We'll never make it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.44,1:14:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一架在医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}The other one's at the hospital.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.16,1:14:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,医院的人可能用它逃生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The people at the hospital probably used it to get out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.16,1:15:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那是我们的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a chance we have to take.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.56,1:15:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们错了 直升机飞走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're wrong and the helicopter's gone…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.04,1:15:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're all dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.72,1:15:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我对了 他们跟着你 也是死路一条\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I'm right, they're dead if they follow you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.12,1:15:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,有辆卡车开过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a truck coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.00,1:15:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,在吉莉安广场\N{\fnArial\fs30}There will be{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.72,1:15:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,将会有紧急疏散\N{\fnArial\fs30}an emergency evacuation from Gilliam Circle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.08,1:15:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,医疗救护和空中救援\N{\fnArial\fs30}Medical care and airlift…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.92,1:15:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,警长 你在这儿干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheriff, what the hell are you doing in there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.23,1:15:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,别操心这个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never mind that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.08,1:15:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要去空中救援点？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys heading to the airlift?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.92,1:15:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.08,1:15:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 跟着我们 没多少时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, follow us. We don't have much time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.12,1:15:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, listen up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.52,1:15:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人都必须马上做出决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody's got to choose right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.76,1:15:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们乘坦克 去医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to the hospital with the tank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.20,1:15:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只需要跑到镇中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all need to go to the center of town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.97,1:15:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没错 - 我跟着我哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's right. - I'm going with my brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.76,1:15:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我和你一起 - 我进坦克去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm with you. - I'm going in the tank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.40,1:15:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,达拉斯 别这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dallas, don't do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.88,1:15:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,她错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.20,1:15:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管是不是兄弟 他错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And brother or not, he's wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.12,1:15:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会害死他们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna get them killed!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.68,1:15:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没时间了 警长 我们必须马上出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're running out of time, Sheriff… we gotta move now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.56,1:16:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,等下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.84,1:16:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们跟你一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're coming with you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.08,1:16:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.56,1:16:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,保重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take care.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.20,1:16:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望我们都错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope we're both wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.80,1:16:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,医疗救护和空中救援\N{\fnArial\fs30}Medical care and airlift…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.44,1:16:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.68,1:16:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,在吉莉安广场\N{\fnArial\fs30}There will be an emergency evacuation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.60,1:16:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,将会有紧急疏散\N{\fnArial\fs30}from Gilliam Circle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.80,1:16:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,医疗救护和空中救援 提供给所有居民\N{\fnArial\fs30}Medical care and airlift will be provided for all residents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.56,1:16:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有救任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't help anybody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.12,1:16:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我太害怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was too scared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.12,1:16:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就看着他们死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just watched them die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.56,1:17:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 穿上这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, put these on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.24,1:17:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.68,1:17:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, listen…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.24,1:17:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管在里面发生什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}whatever happens inside…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.84,1:17:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一不能受伤的是凯莉 明白吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}the only person that can't get hurt is Kelly, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.19,1:17:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都保护凯莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all protect Kelly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.68,1:17:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是哪出 泰坦尼克？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this, the Titanic?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.04,1:17:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,去他妈的妇女孩子先走那一套 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screw the women and children first shit, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.92,1:17:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 白痴 除非你会开直升机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, asshole, unless you can fly the helicopter…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.60,1:17:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然就闭嘴 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}shut the fuck up. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.40,1:18:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Jesus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.20,1:18:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他们都走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe they've all gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.92,1:20:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 上帝 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.04,1:20:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,打死他妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucking shoot it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.96,1:20:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰西 不 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesse, no, wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.20,1:20:47.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move, now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.24,1:21:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesse!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.24,1:21:57.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.24,1:22:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ricky!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.64,1:22:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞奇 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ricky, wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.64,1:22:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗娘养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Motherfucker!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.20,1:22:30.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ricky!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.68,1:22:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.08,1:23:02.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, get up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.08,1:23:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna make it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.04,1:23:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得马上走 现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to go… now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.19,1:23:12.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.20,1:23:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.04,1:23:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 走 走 走 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go, go, go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.12,1:23:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joe!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.60,1:23:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人都在吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this everybody?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.12,1:23:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是所有活着的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is all that's left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.64,1:23:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have you heard?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.88,1:23:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,空中救援马上就到\N{\fnArial\fs30}The airlift will be here soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.28,1:23:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.04,1:23:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.88,1:23:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 走 你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go! You all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.20,1:23:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 茉莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here, Molly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.08,1:23:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑 跑 跟着你妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go! Follow your mom!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.04,1:23:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.88,1:23:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone, move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.12,1:24:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑 茉莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run, Molly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.92,1:24:14.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.32,1:24:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,达拉斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dallas!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.88,1:24:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在试\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.88,1:24:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算用那东西？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you gonna shoot that thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.68,1:24:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.68,1:24:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.04,1:24:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱稳她了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.04,1:24:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,卧倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.32,1:24:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,史迪文上校 这里是吉那森镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Colonel Stevens, this is Gunnison County{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.19,1:24:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,请求疏散 完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}requesting status on evac! Over!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.80,1:25:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,上校 空中救援在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Colonel, where's the airlift?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.12,1:25:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,警长 我们还有10公里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheriff, we are ten miles out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.44,1:25:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,原地待命 完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold your position. Over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.92,1:25:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,上校 我们在这里 完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Colonel, we're here. Over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.28,1:25:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝拯救我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}God help us all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.08,1:25:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 离开这儿 马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, get out of here… now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.40,1:25:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来争取点时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna buy us some time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.84,1:25:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不离开你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not leaving you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.13,1:25:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,上直升机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get to the chopper!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.44,1:25:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不必这样做 达拉斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to do this, Dallas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.12,1:25:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上 去 去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now! Go! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.84,1:25:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,放马过来 狗娘养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, you motherfuckers!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.08,1:25:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.04,1:25:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯莉 趴下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kelly! Get down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.52,1:25:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 走 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.56,1:25:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, over here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.16,1:26:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.80,1:26:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.84,1:26:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,操\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.68,1:26:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, come on over here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.04,1:26:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.60,1:27:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,干你娘的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.44,1:28:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能丢下他不管\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not leaving without him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.08,1:28:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须得走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.00,1:28:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会赶来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll make it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.44,1:28:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Die!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.64,1:28:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.24,1:30:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.24,1:31:17.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭上眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close your eyes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.12,1:31:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抓紧 - 妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hang on! - Mommy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.08,1:31:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,达拉斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dallas?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.08,1:31:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,达拉斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dallas?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.88,1:31:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Jesus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.72,1:31:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你还好吧？瑞奇？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you all right? Ricky?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.32,1:31:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 使劲按 甜心\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Press harder, honey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.08,1:32:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop your weapons!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.72,1:32:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这群王八蛋杀了整个镇子的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bastards killed the entire town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.76,1:32:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只是服从命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're just following orders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.24,1:32:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, put down your weapons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.04,1:32:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我弟弟需要救护\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need a medic for my brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.68,1:32:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,救援马上就到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Medevac is inbound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.36,1:33:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,收集所有武器 建立隔离带\N{\fnArial\fs30}Secure any weapons, and let's set up a perimeter!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:03.20,1:33:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,出发 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go! Move it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.56,1:33:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我跟你说过别撞车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought I told you not to crash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.20,1:33:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.92,1:33:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪物都死了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are the monsters gone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.24,1:33:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.08,1:34:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个世界还没准备好接受这种武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world isn't ready for this technology.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.44,1:34:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这不是给我们的世界准备的 不是吗 尤塔尼女士？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this isn't for our world, is it, Ms. Yutani?{\r}
